# Conversation Ingest APIs > Resource Model

Conversations follow this hierarchical structure.

```
Conversation (conversationId)
├── ownership: conversationOwnerId + ownerType (individual | employee)
├── channel: { type: web|chat|voice|sms|email|other, id }
└── Session (sessionId)
    ├── Participants[]: { id, type, role, startTime?, endTime?, orgId? }
    └── Entries[]
        ├── category: Message | Trace | Entry
        ├── Message: content required, type ∈ { user_message, agent_response }
        └── Trace: payload in variable, type ∈ { agent_reasoning, tool_call, tool_result }
```

